<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">

<head>
    <title>Aegis Dynamics | Contractor Global B2G</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Aegis Dynamics ofera solutii de aparare, securitate nationala, inovatie militara si tehnologie aerospatiala. Platforma B2G pentru tehnica militara si armament greu.">
    <meta name="keywords"
        content="tehnica militara, echipament tactic, achizitii guvernamentale, armament greu, defense contractor, B2G, solutii de aparare, securitate nationala, inovatie militara, tehnologie aerospatiala">
    
    <%- include("../fragmente/head") %>
</head>

<body id="top">
    <%- include("../fragmente/header") %>

    <main class="layout-grid">
        <section id="viziune">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 1</h3>
            <h2><i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Inovatie militara si Tehnologie aerospatiala</h2>
            <p>Suntem un reputat <strong>defense contractor</strong> global, dedicat protejarii valorilor democratice
                printr-o <strong>tehnologie aerospatiala</strong> avansata si <strong>echipament tactic</strong> de
                neegalat.</p>
            <p>Aegis Dynamics se focuseaza exclusiv pe <abbr title="Business-to-Government">B2G</abbr> si pe procedurile
                stricte de <strong>achizitii guvernamentale</strong>.</p>
            <blockquote>
                <q>Securitatea nationala nu este un privilegiu, ci o conditie a pacii moderne.</q>
                — Consiliul de Conducere Aegis
            </blockquote>

            <article>
                <hgroup>
                    <h3>Performanta tactica pe front</h3>
                    <p>Standarde NATO si testare in medii ostile</p>
                </hgroup>
                <p>Implementam <i>stealth technology</i> pe toate platformele noastre aeriene. Acest lucru permite o
                    capacitate operationala care <em>sfideaza</em> aparatele radar inamice.</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section id="proiecte">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 2</h3>
            <h2>Proiecte in Derulare si Stadiu Livrari</h2>

            <details>
                <summary>Intrebare: Care sunt timpii de productie pentru vehicule blindate?</summary>
                <p>Raspuns: Termenul minim de executie depinde de nivelul de blindaj cerut, variind intre 12 si 18 luni
                    pentru comenzile FMS.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Intrebare: Va asumati asistenta tehnica post-vanzare?</summary>
                <p>Raspuns: Da, toate solutiile de aparare beneficiaza de mentenanta prioritara pentru securitate
                    nationala garantata.</p>
            </details>

            <p>F-35 Productie Anuala: <meter value="92" min="0" max="100" low="40" high="80" optimum="95">92%</meter>
                (Optim)</p>
            <p>Artilerie Grea (Testare): <meter value="25" min="0" max="100" low="40" high="80" optimum="95">25%</meter>
                (Intarziat)</p>

            <p>
                Formula energie cinetica pentru evaluarea performantelor aeriene:
            </p>
            <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
                <mi>E</mi>
                <mo>=</mo>
                <mfrac>
                    <mn>1</mn>
                    <mn>2</mn>
                </mfrac>
                <mi>m</mi>
                <msup>
                    <mi>v</mi
                    <mn>2</mn>
                </msup>
            </math>

            <div class="table-container">
                <table id="tabel-proiecte">
                    <caption>Volume de livrari pe anul precedent - <strong>Echipament Tactic</strong></caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Nume Proiect</th>
                        <th>Divizie</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                        <th>Unitati Totale</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>AeroShield</td>
                        <td>Aviatie</td>
                        <td>Finalizat</td>
                        <td><b>120</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>GroundForce</td>
                        <td>Terestru</td>
                        <td>In Progres</td>
                        <td><b>45</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>NightVision Pro</td>
                        <td colspan="2">Inovatie / Tactic (Testare Interna)</td>
                        <td><b>200</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>NavalShield</td>
                        <td>Naval</td>
                        <td>Planificat</td>
                        <td><b>30</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>CyberDefense</td>
                        <td>Cibernetic</td>
                        <td>Pilot</td>
                        <td><b>60</b></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                    <tr>
                        <th colspan="3">Total Unitati Asamblate</th>
                        <td>365</td>
                    </tr>
                </tfoot>
            </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="evenimente">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 3</h3>
            <h2>Evenimente si Expozitii Militare</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Expozitie Aero Defense</b> - <time datetime="2026-05-15T10:00">15 Mai ora 10:00</time> -
                    demonstratie de zbor a noilor drone UAV destinate supravegherii.</li>
                <li><b>Testare Sisteme Terestre</b> - <time datetime="2026-06-20T08:30">20 Iunie ora 08:30</time> -
                    poligonul de testare pentru noile tancuri hibride.</li>
                <li><b>Conferinta FMS</b> - <time datetime="2026-09-10T14:00">10 Septembrie ora 14:00</time> - sesiuni
                    informative privind procedurile de <strong>armament greu</strong>.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="anunturi">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 4</h3>
            <h2>Anunturi oficiale</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse potenti.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="utilizatori-online">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 5</h3>
            <h2>Utilizatori online</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer vehicula sapien nec urna volutpat, non
                facilisis nisl cursus.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="statistici-utilizator">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 6</h3>
            <h2>Date despre utilizator si statistici</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Maecenas varius, ligula in facilisis dapibus,
                sapien nisi pharetra enim, at placerat nisl tortor sed purus.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="site-server">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 7</h3>
            <h2>Date despre site si server</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur sed magna vel lorem tempor mattis.
                Integer at tellus eget odio vulputate pulvinar.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="zona8">
            <h3 class="zona-label">Zona 8</h3>
            <section id="media">
                <h2>Resurse Tehnice si Media</h2>

                <video
                    controls
                    preload="metadata"
                    poster="/resurse/imagini/f35_large.jpg"
                    class="video-aegis"
                >
                    <source src="/resurse/video/aegis_promo.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                    <source src="/resurse/video/aegis_promo.webm" type="video/webm">
                    <track kind="subtitles" src="/resurse/vtt/subtitles_ro.vtt" srclang="ro" label="Romana" default>
                    <track kind="subtitles" src="/resurse/vtt/subtitles_en.vtt" srclang="en" label="English">
                    Browser-ul tau nu suporta elementul video.
                </video>

                <div class="container-iframe">
                    <iframe name="playerAegis" width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/orbzTpqlBok"
                    title="YouTube video player"
                    allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                    allowfullscreen></iframe>
                    <div class="taburi-iframe">
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/na-huvacMKQ?autoplay=1&start=78" target="playerAegis">Prezentare F-35 Lightning II</a>
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/EEXI6r08908?autoplay=1&start=2" target="playerAegis">Sisteme UAV in actiune</a>
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/orbzTpqlBok" target="playerAegis">Armament Greu</a>
                    </div>
                </div>



                <figure>
                    <picture>
                        <source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/f35_large.jpg">
                        <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/f35_medium.jpg">
                        <img src="/resurse/imagini/f35_small.jpg" alt="Aeronava F-35"
                            title="Aeronava F-35 Lightning II executand manevre tactice">
                    </picture>
                    <figcaption>Testarea flotilei aeriene Aegis in conditii meteo extreme.</figcaption>
                </figure>
            </section>

            <section id="documente">
                <h2>Documente tehnice PDF</h2>
                <embed src="/resurse/fisiere/brosura_aegis.pdf" type="application/pdf" height="600" style="width:100%">
            </section>

            <section id="harta-imaginii">
                <h2>Schema interactiva aeronava</h2>
                <img src="/resurse/imagini/f35_large.jpg" alt="Schema aeronava F-35" usemap="#schema-f35" width="800">
                <map name="schema-f35">
                    <area shape="rect" coords="60,60,300,200" href="#viziune" alt="Cockpit si avionica">
                    <area shape="rect" coords="500,350,780,520" href="#proiecte" alt="Sisteme tactice si livrari">
                </map>
            </section>

        
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- e6b18 - produse noi: listate in ordine invers cronologica, cu link catre pagina fiecaruia -->
    <% if (locals.produsNoi && produsNoi.length) { %>
    <section id="produse-noi">
        <h2>Produse Recent Adaugate</h2>
        <ul class="lista-produse-noi">
            <% produsNoi.forEach(function(p) { %>
            <li>
                <a href="/produs/<%= p.id %>">
                    <img src="<%= p.imagine %>" alt="<%= p.nume %>" loading="lazy">
                    <span class="pn-nume"><%= p.nume %></span>
                </a>
                <span class="pn-categorie"><%= p.categorie %></span>
            </li>
            <% }); %>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <% } %>

    <!-- e5 galerie-statica: galerie full-width inclusa ca fragment (acelasi cod ca /galerie) -->
    <%- include("../fragmente/galerie", { imagini: locals.imagini || [] }) %>

    <%- include("../fragmente/footer") %>

    <a href="#top" id="link-top" title="Inapoi la inceputul paginii">
        <div id="triunghi"></div>
    </a>
</body>

</html>
